  d) Placing building materials or equipment outside the construction site in a manner that obstructs the traffic;

  dd) Failure to remove the signs, fences, building equipment, materials, or failure to restore the original condition
  of the road (roadway, sidewalk, and the land area at the sides of the road dedicated to management, maintenance,
